### FundTrack API requests (VS Code REST Client)
### Click "Send Request" above each request to run it.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. List clients → 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/clients

### 2. Create a valid client → 201 Created + Location header
POST {{baseUrl}}/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ali Khan",
  "subaccountNumber": "SA-100004"
}

### 3. Duplicate subaccount number (Sarah's) → 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Someone Else",
  "subaccountNumber": "SA-100001"
}

### 4. Blank name → 400 Bad Request (@NotBlank)
POST {{baseUrl}}/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   ",
  "subaccountNumber": "SA-100005"
}

### 5. Wrong subaccount format → 400 Bad Request (@Pattern)
POST {{baseUrl}}/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bad Format",
  "subaccountNumber": "ABC-1"
}

### 6. Missing field → 400 Bad Request (@NotBlank catches null)
POST {{baseUrl}}/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "No Subaccount"
}

### 7. List funds → 200 OK (MPL100, NRT200, BND300)
GET {{baseUrl}}/funds
